      "output": "+------------+------+-----+-------+\n| student_id | name | age | grade |\n+------------+------+-----+-------+\n| 1          | Ava  | 6   | 73    |\n| 2          | Kate | 15  | 87    |\n+------------+------+-----+-------+",
      "explanation": "The data types of the column grade is converted to int."
    }
  ],
